<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      a {
        color: #007bff;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hello <%= userName %>,</p>
    <p>
      We are pleased to inform you that the BOM document titled "<strong><%= bomDocumentName %></strong>" has been fully approved.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Document Details:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Title:</strong> <%= bomDocumentName %></li>
      <li><strong>Document ID:</strong> <%= bomDocumentId %></li>
    </ul>

    <p>Thank you for your prompt approval and attention to the review process.</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>Your Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
